        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 6,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   Hope I didn't keep you waiting. The L.G.D. meeting took a little longer than expected.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Hope I didn't keep you waiting. The L.G.D. meeting took a little longer than expected."
    },
    {
        "id": 7,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 8,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Don't worry about it, Madam Ch'en.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Don't worry about it, Madam Ch'en."
    },
    {
        "id": 9,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  (She looks like nothing ever happened...)",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "(She looks like nothing ever happened...)"
    },
    {
        "id": 10,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   How's the situation?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "How's the situation?"
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Our scout team has already sent back some information.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Our scout team has already sent back some information."
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   I went through it and picked out a few things that might interest you.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "I went through it and picked out a few things that might interest you."
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Ah, Inspector Hoshiguma...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Ah, Inspector Hoshiguma..."
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]   Don't worry about me. I'm just going to listen in.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "Don't worry about me. I'm just going to listen in."
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   Continue, Amiya. It's fine.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Continue, Amiya. It's fine."
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Very well. We managed to get a lead from some Infected...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Very well. We managed to get a lead from some Infected..."
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   The scout team has already confirmed that there are several Reunion hideouts in Lungmen's residential district.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "The scout team has already confirmed that there are several Reunion hideouts in Lungmen's residential district."
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#5\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5"
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   And?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "And?"
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#5\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   A number of Reunion squads are already planning to launch an attack against Lungmen's defenses.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "A number of Reunion squads are already planning to launch an attack against Lungmen's defenses."
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   We even found an infiltration channel that Reunion had been using.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "We even found an infiltration channel that Reunion had been using."
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   Hah. Such arrogance.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Hah. Such arrogance."
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   They seem to be underestimating the L.G.D.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "They seem to be underestimating the L.G.D."
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   What about the ruins of Chernobog?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "What about the ruins of Chernobog?"
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Rhodes Island dispatched multiple recon squads there.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Rhodes Island dispatched multiple recon squads there."
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   While most of the residents were gone, we did find many Reunion members still active there.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "While most of the residents were gone, we did find many Reunion members still active there."
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   One team even had more than three encounters with Reunion forces.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "One team even had more than three encounters with Reunion forces."
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   However, based upon the intel we have, we are unable to conclusively link the movements in the city to any broader Reunion operations...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "However, based upon the intel we have, we are unable to conclusively link the movements in the city to any broader Reunion operations..."
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   But I would recommend choosing this city as one of our important operation targets in the future.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "But I would recommend choosing this city as one of our important operation targets in the future."
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   ...I see.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "...I see."
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   Hoshiguma, help bring me my forms. Third drawer on the left side of my desk.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Hoshiguma, help bring me my forms. Third drawer on the left side of my desk."
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]   Right now? Sure thing.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "Right now? Sure thing."
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[Dialog(fadetime=0.3)]",
        "type": "dialog_marker",
        "fadetime": 0.3
    },
