    {
        "id": 91,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mephisto\"]   So, you fled back here with your tail between your legs?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mephisto",
        "content": "So, you fled back here with your tail between your legs?"
    },
    {
        "id": 92,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1504_cqbw\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw"
    },
    {
        "id": 93,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  I am no mongrel like you and your lowly kind.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "I am no mongrel like you and your lowly kind."
    },
    {
        "id": 94,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1507_Mephisto_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1"
    },
    {
        "id": 95,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mephisto\"]   ...If not for the fact that you completed your mission, I would have added two more scars to your filthy face.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mephisto",
        "content": "...If not for the fact that you completed your mission, I would have added two more scars to your filthy face."
    },
    {
        "id": 96,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1504_cqbw\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw"
    },
    {
        "id": 97,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  Didn't you lose all your limbs in that explosion? I'd feel sorry making a kid like you put makeup on my face with your mouth.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "Didn't you lose all your limbs in that explosion? I'd feel sorry making a kid like you put makeup on my face with your mouth."
    },
